\title{educationsurveyindia: Access Indian National Sample Survey Education Microdata}
\description{
Query India's National Sample Survey (NSS) 80th round Comprehensive Modular Survey on Education (CMS-E, 2025) unit-level microdata on household, person and erstwhile-member education participation and expenditure, through 'DuckDB' views over 'Parquet' files built from the official release. Also downloads every NSS education survey round (1986-87 to 2025) from the Ministry of Statistics and Programme Implementation ('MoSPI') microdata portal \url{https://microdata.gov.in}.
